{start_of_verse:Verse 1}
[C]I'm nothing [Cdim7]special, in [Dm7]fact I'm a [G7]bit of a 
[C]bore.    <sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down />  <sym bar />  [Gm7]<sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down /> [C7]<sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down />  <sym bar />
If [F]I tell a joke, you've [A7]probably heard it 
[Dm7]before.    <sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down />  <sym bar />  [G7]<sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down />  [Gaug]<sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down />  <sym bar />
But [C]I have a talent, a [G]wonderful thing.
'Cause [C]everyone [C7]listens when [F]I start to [Fm]sing.
I'm so [Am]grateful and proud.  <sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down />  <sym bar />  [F]<sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down />  <sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down />   <sym bar />
All I [Dm]want is to sing it out [G]loud.
[G]So     I     say:
{end_of_verse}

{comment_box: A tempo }
{start_of_chorus: Chorus 1}
[C]Thank you for the [Dm]music, the [G7]songs I'm [C]singing.
[Am]Thanks for [Am7]all the [D7]joy they're [G7]bringing.
[C]Who can live [Dm]without it, I [E7]ask in [Am]all hones[F]ty.
What would life [Fm]be? 
Without a [C]song or a [C7]dance, what are [A7]we?
[A7]So     I     say     [Dm]thank you for the [F]music,
for [G7]giving it to [C]me.    <sym arrow-down />   [Cdim7]<sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down />    <sym bar />  [Dm7]<sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down />   [G7]<sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down />  <sym bar />
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse:Verse 2}
[C]Mother said [Cdim7]I was a [Dm7]dancer long be[G7]fore I could 
[C]walk.    <sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down />  <sym bar />  [Gm7]<sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down /> [C7]<sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down />  <sym bar />
Mmmm, [F]she said I began to [A7]sing long before I could 
[Dm7]talk.    <sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down />  <sym bar />  [G7]<sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down />  [Gaug]<sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down />  <sym bar />
And [C]I've often wondered, how [G]did it all start?
Who [C]found out that [C7]nothing can [F]capture a [Fm]heart
Like a [Am]melody can?  <sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down />  <sym bar />  [F]<sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down />  <sym arrow-down /> <sym arrow-down />   <sym bar />
Well, [Dm]whoever it was, I'm a [G]fan.
[G]So     I     say:
{end_of_verse}

